{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>忙到下午才想起今天還沒喝過水，或想知道咖啡與茶究竟能否補水？Water Reminder 是一套飲水提醒與飲品記錄工具，會按每種飲品的實際補水程度計算，而不是隻累加杯數。它適合上班族、運動人士，以及想重新整理日常飲水習慣的用戶。原價 US $6.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>按實際補水率記錄每杯飲品</h2>\n<p>記錄只需一下點按，水、咖啡、茶、果汁與奶昔都可加入，App 按實際補水比例計算，而非單純累加容量。你可設定起床與就寢時間、提醒頻率與通知音效，睡眠及專注時段會保持安靜。iPhone 與 Apple Watch 原生支援，主畫面與鎖定畫面小工具可查看每日進度，ml 與 oz 隨時切換，全程無廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-257-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-258-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-259-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-260-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-261-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-262-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Water Reminder · Drink Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T10:39:42.785544+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":368,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}